{"4037230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mother Ducker", "steam_appid": 4037230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mother Ducker is a chaotic multiplayer party brawler where 2–8 players battle it out to hoard as many ducklings as possible. Steal from rivals, defend your flock, and dodge the inevitable payback in fast-paced arena mayhem. The more ducklings you’ve got trailing behind you, the faster you move, but the juicier the target on your back; so dodge, chase, and outsmart your friends to prove who’s the ultimate duck wrangler. It’s a hilarious mashup of tag, keep-away, and tug-of-war; easy to pick up, impossible to put down.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mother Ducker is a chaotic multiplayer party brawler where 2–8 players battle it out to hoard as many ducklings as possible. Steal from rivals, defend your flock, and dodge the inevitable payback in fast-paced arena mayhem. The more ducklings you’ve got trailing behind you, the faster you move, but the juicier the target on your back; so dodge, chase, and outsmart your friends to prove who’s the ultimate duck wrangler. It’s a hilarious mashup of tag, keep-away, and tug-of-war; easy to pick up, impossible to put down.</p>", "short_description": "Mother Ducker is a chaotic multiplayer party brawler where 2–8 players battle it out to hoard as many ducklings as possible. Steal from rivals, defend your flock, and dodge the inevitable payback in fast-paced arena mayhem.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037230/e644608eb86617ec535f99adb182de9e66db9ebb/header.jpg?t=1770577046", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037230/e7c5533c3eb03d4727ecc2784b5a15b50ef1276d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770577046", "capsule_imagev5": "ht